@startuml
title WarpTalk - Accept Workspace Invitation

autonumber

<style>
sequenceDiagram {
  participant {
    Margin 10
  }
  box {
    Margin 10
  }
}
</style>

skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Guest User" as User
boundary "Mailbox Page" as Mailbox
boundary "RegisterPage" as Register
boundary "WorkspaceRoomsPage" as Web
control "API Gateway" as Gateway

box "Auth Service" #LightPink
participant ":AuthController" as AuthController <<boundary>>
participant ":AuthService" as AuthService <<service>>
participant ":UserRepository" as UserRepository <<control>>
participant ":RefreshTokenRepository" as RefreshTokenRepository <<control>>
participant ":WorkspaceInvitation\nGrpcClient" as WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient <<boundary>>
database "Auth Database" as AuthDb
end box

box "Workspace Service" #LightBlue
participant ":WorkspaceGrpcService" as WorkspaceGrpcService <<boundary>>
participant ":WorkspaceInvitationService" as WorkspaceInvitationService <<service>>
participant ":WorkspaceInvitationRepository" as WorkspaceInvitationRepository <<control>>
participant ":WorkspaceMemberRepository" as WorkspaceMemberRepository <<control>>
database "Workspace Database" as WorkspaceDb
end box

== STEP 1: OPEN EMAIL & INITIATE JOIN ==

User -> Mailbox : Open Invitation Email
activate Mailbox
Mailbox -> Mailbox : Parse invitation details & token from email body
Mailbox --> User : Display invitation email & "Accept & Join" link
deactivate Mailbox

User -> Mailbox : Click "Accept & Join" link
activate Mailbox
Mailbox -> Register : Open Registration Page (/[workspaceSlug]/join?token=rawToken)
activate Register
deactivate Mailbox

== STEP 2: VERIFY EMAIL EXISTENCE ==

Register -> Gateway : GET /api/v1/auth/check-email?email=guest@email.com
activate Gateway
Gateway -> AuthController : Forward Check Email Request
activate AuthController
AuthController -> AuthService : CheckEmailExistsAsync(email)
activate AuthService
AuthService -> UserRepository : GetByEmailAsync(email)
activate UserRepository
UserRepository -> AuthDb : SELECT * FROM Users WHERE Email = email
activate AuthDb
AuthDb --> UserRepository : User record / null (returns null)
deactivate AuthDb
UserRepository --> AuthService : null
deactivate UserRepository
AuthService --> AuthController : AccountExists (false)
deactivate AuthService
AuthController --> Gateway : 200 OK (AccountExists = false)
deactivate AuthController
Gateway --> Register : 200 OK (AccountExists = false)
deactivate Gateway
Register --> User : Render Registration form (Prompt for Password, Full Name)
deactivate Register

== STEP 3: REGISTER & JOIN WORKSPACE ==

User -> Register : Enter Password, Full Name and Click "Register & Join"
activate Register
Register -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/auth/register-invited [Token, Password, FullName]
activate Gateway
Gateway -> AuthController : Forward Register Invited Request
activate AuthController
AuthController -> AuthService : RegisterInvitedAsync(token, password, fullName)
activate AuthService

AuthService -> WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient : VerifyInvitationToken(Token)
activate WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient
WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient -> WorkspaceGrpcService : gRPC: VerifyInvitationToken(Token)
activate WorkspaceGrpcService
WorkspaceGrpcService -> WorkspaceInvitationService : GetInvitationByTokenAsync(token)
activate WorkspaceInvitationService
WorkspaceInvitationService -> WorkspaceInvitationRepository : GetInvitationByTokenAsync(token)
activate WorkspaceInvitationRepository
WorkspaceInvitationRepository -> WorkspaceDb : SELECT * FROM WorkspaceInvitations WHERE TokenHash = hash
activate WorkspaceDb
WorkspaceDb --> WorkspaceInvitationRepository : Invitation details
deactivate WorkspaceDb
WorkspaceInvitationRepository --> WorkspaceInvitationService : Invitation details
deactivate WorkspaceInvitationRepository
WorkspaceInvitationService --> WorkspaceGrpcService : Invitation details
deactivate WorkspaceInvitationService
WorkspaceGrpcService --> WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient : Invitation details
deactivate WorkspaceGrpcService
WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient --> AuthService : Invitation details
deactivate WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient

AuthService -> UserRepository : AddAsync(new User)
activate UserRepository
UserRepository --> AuthService : Done
deactivate UserRepository

AuthService -> UserRepository : SaveChangesAsync()
activate UserRepository
UserRepository -> AuthDb : INSERT INTO Users
activate AuthDb
AuthDb --> UserRepository : Saved
deactivate AuthDb
UserRepository --> AuthService : Saved
deactivate UserRepository

AuthService -> WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient : AcceptInvitation(Token, UserId, Email)
activate WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient
WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient -> WorkspaceGrpcService : gRPC: AcceptInvitation(Token, UserId, Email)
activate WorkspaceGrpcService
WorkspaceGrpcService -> WorkspaceInvitationService : AcceptInvitationAsync(token, userId, email)
activate WorkspaceInvitationService
WorkspaceInvitationService -> WorkspaceMemberRepository : AddAsync(new WorkspaceMember with Active=true)
activate WorkspaceMemberRepository
WorkspaceMemberRepository --> WorkspaceInvitationService : Done
deactivate WorkspaceMemberRepository
WorkspaceInvitationService -> WorkspaceInvitationRepository : UpdateStatus(token, 'ACCEPTED')
activate WorkspaceInvitationRepository
WorkspaceInvitationRepository --> WorkspaceInvitationService : Done
deactivate WorkspaceInvitationRepository
WorkspaceInvitationService -> WorkspaceInvitationRepository : SaveChangesAsync()
activate WorkspaceInvitationRepository
WorkspaceInvitationRepository -> WorkspaceDb : Save changes (Insert Member, Update Invitation)
activate WorkspaceDb
WorkspaceDb --> WorkspaceInvitationRepository : Saved
deactivate WorkspaceDb
WorkspaceInvitationRepository --> WorkspaceInvitationService : Saved
deactivate WorkspaceInvitationRepository
WorkspaceInvitationService --> WorkspaceGrpcService : Success
deactivate WorkspaceInvitationService
WorkspaceGrpcService --> WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient : Success
deactivate WorkspaceGrpcService
WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient --> AuthService : Success
deactivate WorkspaceInvitationGrpcClient

AuthService -> AuthService : Generate standard JWT & Refresh Token
AuthService -> RefreshTokenRepository : AddAsync(new RefreshToken)
activate RefreshTokenRepository
RefreshTokenRepository --> AuthService : Done
deactivate RefreshTokenRepository
AuthService -> RefreshTokenRepository : SaveChangesAsync()
activate RefreshTokenRepository
RefreshTokenRepository -> AuthDb : Save Refresh Token
activate AuthDb
AuthDb --> RefreshTokenRepository : Saved
deactivate AuthDb
RefreshTokenRepository --> AuthService : Saved
deactivate RefreshTokenRepository

AuthService --> AuthController : Success (Tokens)
deactivate AuthService
AuthController --> Gateway : 200 OK (Tokens)
deactivate AuthController
Gateway --> Register : 200 OK (Workspace joined)
deactivate Gateway
Register -> Web : Route to Workspace Rooms Page (/[workspaceSlug]/rooms)
activate Web
deactivate Register
Web --> User : Render Workspace Rooms page successfully (Join Completed)
deactivate Web
@enduml
